Expanding with index notation and contracting epsilons,
$ (vb(a) times vb(b)) dot (vb(b) times vb(c)) & = epsilon_(i j k) a_j b_k epsilon_(i p q) b_p c_q \
 & = (delta_(j p) delta_(k q) - delta_(j q) delta_(k p)) a_j b_k b_p c_q \
 & = (vb(a) dot vb(b))(vb(b) dot vb(c)) - (vb(a) dot vb(c)) abs(vb(b))^2. $
